---

Choose field equipment by rehearsing the exact NAHPU workflow you plan to run.
NAHPU works on phones, tablets, and computers; see the
[Installation guide](/en/installation/) for supported platforms. The table
below lists devices used on past expeditions so you can compare them with your
own field season.

## Devices used in field expeditions

